@startuml
title UML sequence - Implemented saved opening and independent control review
actor Customer
participant "Customer web" as Web
participant "API / BFF" as API
participant "Journeys" as Journeys
participant "Platform jobs" as Jobs
participant "Worker" as Worker
participant "Controls" as Controls
participant "Signed simulator" as Provider
actor Reviewer
actor Approver
participant "Core" as Core
participant "Documents" as Docs
Customer -> Web : Save profile, evidence and accepted exact terms
Web -> API : Scoped command + CSRF + stable key
API -> Journeys : Save durable generation and references
Journeys -> Docs : Validate current attributable acceptance
API -> Journeys : Submit current generation
Journeys -> Jobs : Accept original operation and schedule work
Jobs --> Web : Accepted / operation reference
Worker -> Jobs : Claim bounded lease and fence
Worker -> Journeys : Process original operation
Journeys -> Controls : Current identity, sanctions and risk gates
Controls -> Provider : Original request + input / policy identity
Provider --> Controls : Authenticated signed decision
alt Current REVIEW
 Controls -> Controls : Preserve original; create owned case
 Journeys -> Jobs : Review required (same operation)
 Reviewer -> Controls : Claim; inspect; propose disposition
 Approver -> Controls : Approve as a different canonical person
 Controls -> Controls : Immutable independent manual decision
 Worker -> Journeys : Resume original operation when current gates allow
else Current DENY
 Journeys -> Journeys : Final declined application; no account
end
Journeys -> Docs : Recheck current acceptance before positive opening
Journeys -> Core : Stable party and restricted account business key
Core -> Journeys : Validate concrete opening policy at activation
Journeys --> Core : Bound current control / terms / generation evidence
Core -> Core : Activate once; emit owned outbox fact
Core --> Journeys : Existing or newly activated account ID
Journeys -> Journeys : Save ACTIVE / account reference
Worker -> Jobs : Fenced completion
Customer -> Web : Reload or return after fresh issuer login
Web -> API : Retrieve same saved application / operation
note over Journeys,Core
Lost Core acknowledgement retries the same opening identity.
Current terms and changed generation block stale activation.
end note
@enduml
